{"path":"memory/memory_resource/operator_eq","title":"std::pmr::operator==, std::pmr::operator!=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::pmr::</span>operator==, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::pmr::</span>operator!=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/memory_resource/operator_eq","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Compares the memory_resources a and b for equality. Two memory_resources compare equal if and only if memory allocated from one memory_resource can be deallocated from the other and vice versa.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/memory_resource\">&lt;memory_resource&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/memory_resource\"><span class=\"kw712\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pmr</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">memory_resource</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> a,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/memory_resource\"><span class=\"kw712\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pmr</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">memory_resource</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> b <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17 t-until-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>